      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "Queue is a Group feature at instance creation time, unavailable to Public/Friends+/Friends/Invite+/Invite. It's up to the group to decide whether to use a queue or not, when an instance is created.\n\nQueues can also be undesired.",
