  "deleteID": null,
  "deletedAt": null,
  "deletedBy": null,
  "details": "As it is right now, if you try to join a full instance with no active queue, you just get a “instance is full” message and nothing happens.\n\nHowever, if the instance already has an active queue, you can join the queue and it works as expected.\n\nThis is really inconsistent and confusing. \n\nBetter behavior: If an instance is full, pressing the join button should either ask the user if they want to start a queue, or automatically start one and put them in it.",
